          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Command phase, one **^^Officer^^** model embarked within this **^^Transport^^** can issue Orders even though it is not on the battlefield. When doing so, measure distances to and from this *^^Transport^^**.</characteristic>
