          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your opponent’s Shooting phase, you can roll one D6: on a 1, this **^^Psyker^^**’s unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 2+, until the end of the phase, models in this **^^Psyker^^**’s unit have a 4+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
