          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of your Command phase, if the bearer&apos;s unit is below its Starting Strength, you can return up to D3 destroyed **^^Platoon^^** (excluding **^^Characters^^**) to this unit.</characteristic>
