            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, roll one D6: on a 3+, do not remove it from play – it can, after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, shoot with its inferno gun as if it were your Shooting phase and as if it had its full wounds remaining. This model is then removed from play.</characteristic>
