            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit has a 5+ Invulnerable Save against ranged attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Transport" id="4b48-4a9d-515d-536a" hidden="false" typeId="74f8-5443-9d6d-1f1e" typeName="Transport">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Capacity" typeId="30f2-be70-861d-1b84">This model has a transport capacity of 30 **^^Astra Militarum Infantry^^** models. Each Heavy Weapons Team model and Veteran Heavy Weapons Team model takes up the space of 2 models. Each **^^Ogryn^^** model takes up the space of 3 models. It cannot transport **^^Artillery^^** models.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mount Up!" id="e198-4e1a-984e-307a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the end of your opponent’s Movement phase, if there are no models currently embarked within this **^^Transport^^**, you can select one friendly **^^Astra Militarum Infantry^^** unit (excluding **^^Artillery^^** units) that is wholly within 6&quot; of this **^^Transport^^**. Unless that unit is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can embark within this **^^Transport^^**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
