            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, after this model has shot, if one or more of those attacks made with an Indirect Fire weapon scored a hit against an enemy unit, that unit must take a Battle-shock test (if an **^^Infantry^^** unit is hit by one or more attacks made by a multiple rocket launcher, they must subtract 1 from their Battle-shock test when doing so).</characteristic>
