          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an Order is issued to this model&apos;s unit, this model can issue that Order to one other friendly **^^Platoon^^** or **^^Ogryn^^** unit in the same way as an **^^Officer^^**.</characteristic>
