                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Officer^^** model only. While the bearer is leading a unit, each time a model in that unit makes a ranged attack, if that unit Remained Stationary this turn, a Critical Hit is scored on a successful unmodified Hit roll of 5+.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
