                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Astra Militarum Officer^^** model only. Each time you select a unit for this **^^Officer^^** model to issue an Order to, that unit can be within 12&quot; instead of within 6&quot;.</characteristic>
